Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:32:16.000 --> 00:32:31.000
Whitney Hodges: I would say it really depends on what the end goal is for the client. Majority of our client base signs on with us and then really stays on with us indefinitely. I mean, we still have our first clients that we signed on 6 years ago.

00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:23.000
rose: Okay.

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:29.000
rose: Yep.

00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:33.000
rose: Okay.

00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:48.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, but then there are others that are more like, um, you know, I want you to really kind of, like, get me on the fast track for success with ads, and then from there, I feel like I'm tech-savvy enough that I can kind of take it over or start to manage it.

00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:48.000
rose: Okay.

00:32:48.000 --> 00:33:00.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, or others that are more, like, uh, end up hiring somebody in-house to handle their marketing and ads and things like that, right? So it's where they'll, like, turn it over to a team member internally.

00:32:56.000 --> 00:32:57.000
rose: Okay.

00:32:59.000 --> 00:33:00.000
rose: Okay.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:02.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Mm-hmm.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:15.000
rose: Okay. Yeah, because, I mean, I think that I, um, you know, could see this being long-term, but I am also a one-woman show, so, like, you know, if I fast-track and book eight weddings, then it's sort of like, okay, then maybe I can lay off the ads. So, we'll just sort of…

00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:10.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:33:14.000 --> 00:33:16.000
Whitney Hodges: Right.

00:33:15.000 --> 00:33:25.000
rose: see what happens with that front. But there's no, like, you have to stay for 12 months or something like that. Is that what I'm hearing?

00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:17.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:28.000
Whitney Hodges: It's an initial 6-month commitment, and then from there, it goes month to month.

00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:27.000
rose: Okay.

00:33:28.000 --> 00:33:31.000
rose: Okay, that sounds good. Yeah.

00:33:28.000 --> 00:33:30.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:35.000
Whitney Hodges: Perfect. Did that calendar invite come through for you tomorrow, Rose?

00:33:31.000 --> 00:33:33.000
rose: Cool.

00:33:34.000 --> 00:33:37.000
rose: Um, let me see…

00:33:38.000 --> 00:33:42.000
rose: Not yet. Let me just refresh here. Yep, it did.

00:33:42.000 --> 00:33:44.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, perfect.

00:33:44.000 --> 00:33:51.000
Whitney Hodges: Alright, well then, um, I'll get some more information to you in the meantime, but we'll plan to meet again tomorrow.

00:33:52.000 --> 00:33:54.000
Whitney Hodges: You too, Rose, so nice to meet you.

